Subject: [PATCH 5/8] maplex: Settings sections (backend, official board)

Copy strings live in maplex/copy/ and are appended by finalize.cjs, so upstream's copy.csv growth never conflicts.

diff --git a/dashboard/src/pages/SettingsPage.jsx b/dashboard/src/pages/SettingsPage.jsx
index a081b14f658810af453f153637fd447c36f584c0..665e9216e52369372d07de1e5161ce5bef063289 100644
